1
00:00:02,530 --> 00:00:06,170
I fell for you
because you're Mayama.

2
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:08,000
Why?

3
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:09,810
Because you're Mayama.

4
00:00:12,170 --> 00:00:13,880
That doesn't answer my question at all.

5
00:00:17,510 --> 00:00:21,380
Why do I like him so much?

6
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:25,090
Only one thing is for sure.

7
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:30,990
Mayama is my first love.

8
00:00:39,370 --> 00:00:41,070
Why do you want to go out with me?

9
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:44,270
Because you're so handsome, Asamiya-kun.

10
00:00:44,460 --> 00:00:45,840
And you're really sweet.

11
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:48,510
We've never even talked before, have we?

12
00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:50,910
How do you know I'm sweet?

13
00:00:56,820 --> 00:00:58,460
It doesn't really have to be me, does it?

14
00:01:02,620 --> 00:01:06,300
My whole life, I've always been
defined solely by my looks.

15
00:01:08,100 --> 00:01:09,900
Another confession?

16
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:12,230
How many is that since we started school?

17
00:01:12,340 --> 00:01:14,059
It's happening even more
often than in middle school.

18
00:01:14,060 --> 00:01:15,320
Yeah, I don't know.

19
00:01:15,340 --> 00:01:16,270
I'm not keeping track.

20
00:01:16,271 --> 00:01:17,499
That's amazing.

21
00:01:17,500 --> 00:01:19,110
Must be nice.

22
00:01:21,140 --> 00:01:23,010
Um, that's my seat.

23
00:01:23,540 --> 00:01:24,680
Oh, sorry.

24
00:01:27,880 --> 00:01:29,426
- I wish someone would confess to me.
- I really want a confession.

25
00:01:29,450 --> 00:01:30,919
We just started high school.

26
00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:31,920
True.

27
00:01:32,020 --> 00:01:33,540
There will be plenty of chances later.

28
00:01:34,060 --> 00:01:38,330
At that time, Mayama was just
another classmate to me.

29
00:01:40,700 --> 00:01:41,700
Crap.

30
00:01:42,030 --> 00:01:43,800
Why am I the only one in a different class?

31
00:01:44,230 --> 00:01:48,240
Asamiya, I know you have to reject them,
but try not to break their hearts too much.

32
00:01:53,140 --> 00:01:54,140
Sorry.

33
00:01:54,380 --> 00:01:55,840
Sakaki is right.

34
00:01:56,750 --> 00:01:58,680
Even if people only judge me by my looks,

35
00:01:59,380 --> 00:02:02,450
that's no excuse for me to hurt them.

36
00:02:04,950 --> 00:02:06,790
I'm really happy
that you have feelings for me.

37
00:02:07,590 --> 00:02:08,590
But...

38
00:02:09,500 --> 00:02:10,500
It's okay...

39
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:12,360
Thank you.

40
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:17,830
I suppressed my true self
and tried hard to act nice.

41
00:02:21,900 --> 00:02:22,640
Let's go.
Hurry up, let's go.

42
00:02:23,341 --> 00:02:24,539
Did you get it?

43
00:02:24,540 --> 00:02:25,670
Hurry, we've been spotted.

44
00:02:26,480 --> 00:02:27,840
I think it turned out pretty good.

45
00:02:32,920 --> 00:02:33,920
Asamiya.

46
00:02:34,080 --> 00:02:35,160
Can I bother you for a sec?

47
00:03:19,200 --> 00:03:25,500
"After Moving Seats, The Boy Behind Me Has A Crush On Me"
(Episode 4)

48
00:03:26,700 --> 00:03:28,540
I'm really happy
that you have feelings for me.

49
00:03:29,460 --> 00:03:30,460
But...

50
00:03:31,410 --> 00:03:33,980
It's okay... Thank you.

51
00:03:37,910 --> 00:03:39,050
What is this?

52
00:03:40,100 --> 00:03:43,133
[Comments on how hot Asamiya is
from the video of the confession rejection]

53
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:45,250
This is way too far.

54
00:03:46,220 --> 00:03:47,260
Are there any others?

55
00:03:48,220 --> 00:03:49,220
Huh?

56
00:03:49,390 --> 00:03:50,390
This is ridiculous.

57
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:54,130
Excuse me.

58
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:55,429
I saw the video.

59
00:03:55,430 --> 00:03:56,630
Can I take a picture with you?

60
00:03:58,220 --> 00:03:59,330
What for?

61
00:04:00,220 --> 00:04:01,220
Huh?

62
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:03,570
To post on social media for likes?

63
00:04:04,170 --> 00:04:06,210
Using me as a tool to validate yourselves?

64
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:10,750
Can you go bother someone else with this?

65
00:04:11,150 --> 00:04:12,810
No one has ever cared

66
00:04:13,450 --> 00:04:14,980
about my true feelings...

67
00:04:15,180 --> 00:04:16,460
What's his deal?

68
00:04:16,500 --> 00:04:18,150
He's totally different from the video.

69
00:04:18,420 --> 00:04:20,790
He's just a pretty face.
Isn't he a bit too arrogant?

70
00:04:20,840 --> 00:04:21,860
Seriously.

71
00:04:22,060 --> 00:04:24,260
Going to an all-boys
school was the right choice.

72
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:28,539
At least in this school,
I can have some peace and quiet.

73
00:04:28,540 --> 00:04:31,270
Asamiya would probably
look hot in drag, right?

74
00:04:31,300 --> 00:04:33,700
If I could get a picture
of Asamiya in drag,

75
00:04:34,270 --> 00:04:35,970
my account would definitely blow up.

76
00:04:39,370 --> 00:04:40,380
What the hell.

77
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:43,180
They don't know anything about me.

78
00:04:43,260 --> 00:04:45,150
Hey, go ask him for us.

79
00:04:46,220 --> 00:04:50,590
But... Asamiya probably wouldn't like that.

80
00:04:52,450 --> 00:04:54,050
You really can't read the room, can you?

81
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:56,730
But it still depends on
how Asamiya feels about it...

82
00:04:56,740 --> 00:04:59,960
Come on, it's just a joke.

83
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:01,000
But...

84
00:05:02,900 --> 00:05:03,900
Forget it.

85
00:05:04,100 --> 00:05:05,930
You're such a buzzkill.

86
00:05:17,650 --> 00:05:19,450
Why don't you just
dress up in drag yourself?

87
00:05:20,200 --> 00:05:21,200
Okay.

88
00:05:37,180 --> 00:05:39,020
Sakaki has the worst luck.

89
00:05:39,060 --> 00:05:41,460
Of all things, he had to be on
the beautification committee.

90
00:05:44,810 --> 00:05:46,580
Uh...

91
00:05:46,880 --> 00:05:49,140
You're waiting for Sakaki, right?

92
00:05:51,280 --> 00:05:52,010
Yeah.

93
00:05:52,050 --> 00:05:54,450
It seems he got caught
slacking off by a teacher.

94
00:05:54,820 --> 00:05:57,850
The teacher made him stay behind alone.

95
00:05:58,190 --> 00:05:59,820
So I think it'll be a while.

96
00:06:00,640 --> 00:06:01,640
I see.

97
00:06:01,760 --> 00:06:04,060
I'll go check on Sakaki then.

98
00:06:07,300 --> 00:06:10,930
That was my first conversation with Mayama.

99
00:06:13,140 --> 00:06:15,270
Huh? The class journal...

100
00:06:28,050 --> 00:06:29,080
What are you doing?

101
00:06:29,890 --> 00:06:31,890
The journal hasn't been filled out.

102
00:06:35,590 --> 00:06:37,360
The person on duty must have forgotten.

103
00:06:37,530 --> 00:06:39,060
It's not your job, Mayama.

104
00:06:40,130 --> 00:06:41,730
But I already saw it.

105
00:06:43,630 --> 00:06:45,570
Do you have to write it
just because you saw it?

106
00:06:46,770 --> 00:06:48,800
He probably didn't forget on purpose.

107
00:06:49,470 --> 00:06:51,510
It'd be a shame if he
got yelled at for this.

108
00:06:56,220 --> 00:06:57,220
Earlier...

109
00:06:57,580 --> 00:06:59,100
Why did you stand up for me like that?

110
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:01,800
Huh?

111
00:07:03,450 --> 00:07:06,920
When everyone was
pressuring me to dress in drag.

112
00:07:08,290 --> 00:07:11,860
Saying that would only make them hate you.

113
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:19,740
But aren't your feelings more important?

114
00:07:25,270 --> 00:07:29,580
If it were me, I'd definitely feel
really uncomfortable being told that.

115
00:07:30,550 --> 00:07:33,080
So I figured you'd feel uncomfortable too.

116
00:07:35,080 --> 00:07:36,920
But that was just my assumption.

117
00:07:37,890 --> 00:07:40,560
I don't care if I get hated anyway.

118
00:07:51,630 --> 00:07:52,700
Asamiya?

119
00:07:54,870 --> 00:07:55,970
It's nothing.

120
00:08:06,750 --> 00:08:11,450
Mayama's words gently seeped
into my already shattered heart.

121
00:08:13,760 --> 00:08:14,990
Ever since then,

122
00:08:19,700 --> 00:08:22,030
I've been watching Mayama from afar.

123
00:08:24,540 --> 00:08:27,040
Ah, um, you dropped this.

124
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:28,800
Thank you.
You're welcome.

125
00:08:29,770 --> 00:08:32,240
At first, just looking at him
like this was enough for me.

126
00:08:32,920 --> 00:08:33,980
Thanks.

127
00:08:34,380 --> 00:08:35,810
That's a huge help.

128
00:08:35,940 --> 00:08:36,940
No problem.

129
00:08:41,950 --> 00:08:43,190
But gradually...

130
00:08:43,220 --> 00:08:44,220
Mayama.

131
00:08:44,720 --> 00:08:45,920
There's still some bread left.

132
00:08:49,660 --> 00:08:50,959
I'll take this one then.

133
00:08:50,960 --> 00:08:52,590
Welcome. That'll be 120 yen.

134
00:08:52,630 --> 00:08:55,660
I started to find the clumsy
yet sweet Mayama really cute.

135
00:08:58,470 --> 00:09:00,200
I wanted to get closer to him.

136
00:09:02,770 --> 00:09:04,040
I wanted to touch him.

137
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:09,010
I wanted to hold him.

138
00:09:30,030 --> 00:09:31,470
I wanted to make him mine.

139
00:09:33,060 --> 00:09:35,340
Those feelings gradually
turned into this kind of desire.

140
00:09:37,670 --> 00:09:40,010
Realizing that this was "love"

141
00:09:41,780 --> 00:09:43,780
didn't take much time at all.

142
00:09:49,950 --> 00:09:52,920
But I also knew
that even if I confessed my feelings,

143
00:09:54,860 --> 00:09:57,660
it would only cause trouble for Mayama.

144
00:10:01,880 --> 00:10:06,940
But we ended up in the same
class again in our second year.

145
00:10:09,580 --> 00:10:11,470
Mayama was sitting right in front of me.

146
00:10:18,980 --> 00:10:20,880
I couldn't suppress these feelings anymore.

147
00:10:31,230 --> 00:10:32,260
Huh?

148
00:10:38,620 --> 00:10:42,800
I already knew it would only bother him.

149
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:13,770
You can definitely find someone better.

150
00:11:18,110 --> 00:11:20,640
Why did I say something like that...?

151
00:11:46,400 --> 00:11:50,030
This konjac might be a bit in the way.

152
00:11:50,040 --> 00:11:51,400
We probably don't need it.

153
00:11:51,440 --> 00:11:52,910
Konjac is delicious.

154
00:11:54,410 --> 00:11:56,910
I haven't been able to
talk to Asamiya properly.

155
00:11:58,010 --> 00:12:00,050
Time just slipped away like this.

156
00:12:00,460 --> 00:12:02,080
He probably doesn't know.

157
00:12:02,150 --> 00:12:03,790
Yeah, he probably has no idea about this.

158
00:12:06,340 --> 00:12:08,220
- I don't think he knows.
- That's pretty rough.

159
00:12:09,180 --> 00:12:10,180
What should we do?

160
00:12:10,730 --> 00:12:11,799
No way.

161
00:12:11,800 --> 00:12:13,600
Please cut us some slack,
Komori-chan.

162
00:12:13,620 --> 00:12:16,306
Komori-chan, if this keeps up, we won't
be ready for the cultural festival in time.

163
00:12:16,330 --> 00:12:19,970
Even so, you can't sneak into the
school in the middle of the night.

164
00:12:20,220 --> 00:12:21,040
And another thing,

165
00:12:21,170 --> 00:12:23,240
don't call your homeroom
teacher by a nickname.

166
00:12:27,820 --> 00:12:29,580
Komori-chan.

167
00:12:32,380 --> 00:12:34,550
Even if we have to think of another way...

168
00:12:34,980 --> 00:12:36,736
Should we go to someone's
house to work on it?

169
00:12:36,760 --> 00:12:39,660
My sister is studying for exams,
so we can't be too loud.

170
00:12:39,760 --> 00:12:42,290
I have five siblings at home.
Absolutely not.

171
00:12:43,190 --> 00:12:44,230
What about Asamiya?

172
00:12:45,060 --> 00:12:45,690
Huh?

173
00:12:45,691 --> 00:12:47,291
Asamiya's house is probably huge, right?

174
00:12:47,360 --> 00:12:48,519
Even though none of
us have ever been inside.

175
00:12:48,520 --> 00:12:49,780
Whoa.

176
00:12:49,800 --> 00:12:50,900
Ah...

177
00:12:53,100 --> 00:12:54,400
Then how about...

178
00:13:00,260 --> 00:13:03,019
Wow, it's pretty spacious.

179
00:13:03,020 --> 00:13:05,660
Yeah. We should be able to make
good progress on our work here.

180
00:13:05,980 --> 00:13:07,180
That's great.

181
00:13:07,780 --> 00:13:09,590
By the way,
Mayama's house is pretty far.

182
00:13:09,790 --> 00:13:11,590
Why did you specifically choose our school?

183
00:13:11,920 --> 00:13:13,720
Well...

184
00:13:13,760 --> 00:13:15,520
I'll just leave the tea and snacks here.

185
00:13:15,760 --> 00:13:16,879
Thank you.

186
00:13:16,880 --> 00:13:20,160
Not at all.
I'm just glad Hare brought friends over.

187
00:13:20,560 --> 00:13:21,630
Take your time, you guys.

188
00:13:24,300 --> 00:13:25,300
Okay.

189
00:13:25,430 --> 00:13:26,900
Let's get started then.

190
00:13:27,920 --> 00:13:30,299
We need to finish this by morning.

191
00:13:30,300 --> 00:13:32,610
- Hell yeah.
- Okay.

192
00:13:33,880 --> 00:13:35,110
What the heck are you doing?

193
00:13:36,360 --> 00:13:40,940
- [*Teenage boy yelling*]
- "Hell yeah" my foot.

194
00:13:41,100 --> 00:13:42,420
Hurry up and get to work.

195
00:13:43,120 --> 00:13:45,750
We can practice
Frankenstein anytime anyway.

196
00:13:45,790 --> 00:13:47,020
- Right?
- No, no.

197
00:13:47,080 --> 00:13:48,839
Today is the day we all
work on our project together.

198
00:13:48,840 --> 00:13:50,030
Oh, right.

199
00:13:51,430 --> 00:13:54,130
- It's so hot.
- Way too hot.

200
00:13:54,900 --> 00:13:56,430
How is it?

201
00:13:57,480 --> 00:13:59,120
- Snow.
- Wrong.

202
00:14:24,930 --> 00:14:26,840
I'm going to the
convenience store for a bit.

203
00:14:28,130 --> 00:14:29,160
I'll come too.

204
00:14:33,700 --> 00:14:34,700
Okay.

205
00:14:48,560 --> 00:14:49,840
We're being a bother, aren't we?

206
00:14:50,450 --> 00:14:51,450
Huh?

207
00:14:52,100 --> 00:14:54,160
Three guys suddenly crashing at your place.

208
00:14:54,860 --> 00:14:55,860
Ah...

209
00:14:55,920 --> 00:14:56,930
It's totally fine.

210
00:14:58,390 --> 00:15:01,000
It's the first time my
room has been this lively.

211
00:15:02,260 --> 00:15:05,470
If just lending my room helps everyone out,
then I'm happy to do it.

212
00:15:08,280 --> 00:15:10,540
That's so like you, Mayama.

213
00:15:12,420 --> 00:15:16,580
Plus, I really want the
cultural festival to be a success.

214
00:15:19,410 --> 00:15:22,449
Getting together with everyone like this
to excitedly prepare for something...

215
00:15:22,450 --> 00:15:23,690
It's a first for me.

216
00:15:25,990 --> 00:15:27,490
Back in middle school,

217
00:15:31,330 --> 00:15:33,560
my friends used to tease me a lot.

218
00:15:36,570 --> 00:15:37,570
One time,

219
00:15:38,070 --> 00:15:40,370
they pulled a massive prank on me.

220
00:15:43,560 --> 00:15:48,040
They told me a girl in our
class had a crush on me,

221
00:15:49,240 --> 00:15:51,080
and that she wanted to go out with me.

222
00:15:54,180 --> 00:15:56,590
At the summer festival, I told her,

223
00:15:57,950 --> 00:16:00,620
"I'm really happy you like me."

224
00:16:02,690 --> 00:16:03,760
But then,

225
00:16:05,130 --> 00:16:07,330
she just asked, "What
are you talking about?"

226
00:16:08,520 --> 00:16:12,070
"Hey, hey, it was obviously a joke!"

227
00:16:12,100 --> 00:16:13,699
My friends came running out, laughing.

228
00:16:13,700 --> 00:16:16,309
"Like anyone would ever
have a crush on Mayama!"

229
00:16:16,310 --> 00:16:17,010
Yeah.

230
00:16:17,011 --> 00:16:20,240
To them, it was probably
just a harmless prank.

231
00:16:27,680 --> 00:16:30,020
Of course something
like that would hurt you.

232
00:16:34,160 --> 00:16:35,520
Using you as a prop

233
00:16:36,260 --> 00:16:37,530
just to have a good laugh...

234
00:16:40,560 --> 00:16:41,760
That's just cruel.

235
00:16:47,240 --> 00:16:48,240
So,

236
00:16:49,770 --> 00:16:51,870
I'm really happy about
your feelings, Asamiya.

237
00:16:53,880 --> 00:16:55,380
And even though I want to believe it,

238
00:17:01,460 --> 00:17:03,190
I'm still scared.

239
00:17:07,940 --> 00:17:08,940
That's why...

240
00:17:11,230 --> 00:17:13,310
I hope you can give me a
little more time to answer.

241
00:17:20,280 --> 00:17:21,500
I'll wait as long as it takes.

242
00:17:24,560 --> 00:17:26,680
You don't have to force
yourself to give an answer.

243
00:17:33,020 --> 00:17:34,020
Yeah.

244
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:57,070
We're back!

245
00:18:15,190 --> 00:18:16,190
Ouch.

246
00:18:17,220 --> 00:18:18,220
Are you okay?

247
00:18:18,960 --> 00:18:22,130
I just pricked myself with a needle.
I'll just lick it, it's fine.

248
00:18:26,070 --> 00:18:27,570
You need to disinfect it properly.

249
00:18:48,420 --> 00:18:49,420
I'm sorry.

250
00:18:50,800 --> 00:18:51,800
Huh?

251
00:18:52,120 --> 00:18:54,040
I haven't been considering
your feelings at all.

252
00:18:54,160 --> 00:18:57,500
I just kept irresponsibly saying
I like you, I like you.

253
00:18:58,630 --> 00:19:00,300
I made you uncomfortable.

254
00:19:01,370 --> 00:19:02,439
That's not true...

255
00:19:02,440 --> 00:19:06,340
You're always so thoughtful of me.

256
00:19:08,110 --> 00:19:09,140
No.

257
00:19:09,880 --> 00:19:11,880
I didn't feel uncomfortable.

258
00:19:14,080 --> 00:19:15,680
It's just that lately,

259
00:19:17,520 --> 00:19:21,320
I haven't known
how to act around you.

260
00:19:23,360 --> 00:19:24,160
That's...

261
00:19:24,161 --> 00:19:26,960
You can just act like you normally do.

262
00:19:28,860 --> 00:19:29,900
I know.

263
00:19:32,570 --> 00:19:33,570
But...

264
00:19:41,860 --> 00:19:42,860
Shall we keep going?

265
00:20:07,860 --> 00:20:08,860
Mayama?

266
00:20:09,240 --> 00:20:10,240
Ah.

267
00:20:10,760 --> 00:20:11,760
Sorry.

268
00:20:13,180 --> 00:20:14,420
You should take a little break.

269
00:20:15,340 --> 00:20:16,650
I'm fine.

270
00:20:18,450 --> 00:20:20,250
I guess I'm just relieved.

271
00:20:22,400 --> 00:20:25,320
Because I can finally
talk to you properly again.

272
00:20:28,360 --> 00:20:29,790
You're way too cute.

273
00:20:34,380 --> 00:20:35,820
On the day of the cultural festival,

274
00:20:38,100 --> 00:20:40,900
if it's okay with you, let's look
around together during our free time.

275
00:20:42,840 --> 00:20:43,840
Yeah.

276
00:20:45,720 --> 00:20:47,340
I want to get crepes.

277
00:20:49,010 --> 00:20:50,010
Sounds good.

278
00:20:50,810 --> 00:20:51,810
And takoyaki.

279
00:20:53,040 --> 00:20:54,050
And...

280
00:21:00,140 --> 00:21:01,220
Mayama?

281
00:22:39,000 --> 00:22:41,000
(Kitahara Festival 2026 ~Starlight~)

282
00:22:41,190 --> 00:22:43,730
- Looks pretty good.
- Thanks.

283
00:22:56,000 --> 00:22:57,800
(Incoming Call: Mayama Ten (Big Brother))

284
00:23:01,600 --> 00:23:02,780
Hello?

285
00:23:03,510 --> 00:23:04,580
Asamiya-kun.

286
00:23:04,710 --> 00:23:06,019
Good morning.

287
00:23:06,020 --> 00:23:09,820
I'm sorry, but Hare probably won't be able
to make it to the cultural festival today.

288
00:23:10,150 --> 00:23:11,150
Huh?

289
00:24:39,300 --> 00:24:40,100
(Next Episode Preview)

290
00:24:40,140 --> 00:24:41,339
I want to give it my best shot.

291
00:24:41,340 --> 00:24:43,076
After all, we all prepared
for this together.

292
00:24:43,100 --> 00:24:44,239
Victory!

293
00:24:44,240 --> 00:24:46,300
I think I can finally say it now.

294
00:24:46,320 --> 00:24:48,920
My answer to you, Asamiya.

295
00:24:48,980 --> 00:24:51,220
Let's just stay like this for a bit.

296
00:24:51,280 --> 00:24:53,820
When you make that face,
I just can't stop myself.
